WEBVTT

NOTE These subtitles describe on-screen actions; they are not an audio transcript.

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Tap Add plant and choose the plant type.
This example uses Flower.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.000
Give the plant a name: Rose 9.

00:14.000 --> 00:23.000
Add an optional location and ZIP code,
then save the plant.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
Open Assess and select Rose 9.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.000
Photograph the rose bush, then tap Analyze.

00:29.000 --> 00:39.000
The assessment runs on this phone.
Processing time varies by device.

00:39.000 --> 00:46.000
Review the health score and suggested care.
AI results can be wrong.

00:46.000 --> 00:54.000
Open the plant record to see watering controls,
plant information, and assessment history.

00:54.000 --> 00:57.000
Return to the plant list and choose another plant.

00:57.000 --> 01:02.233
Orange #4 shows its watering status and timeline.
Tap Refresh to update its plant information.
